<script setup lang="ts">import { useAttrs } from 'vue'; defineOptions({ inheritAttrs: false }); withDefaults(defineProps<{ modelValue?: string | null }>(), { modelValue: '' }); defineEmits<{ 'update:modelValue': [value: string] }>(); const attrs = useAttrs()</script>
<template><textarea v-bind="attrs" :value="modelValue" class="min-h-28 w-full resize-y rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-gray-700 shadow-input outline-none transition placeholder:text-gray-400 focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:ring-offset-2" @input="$emit('update:modelValue', ($event.target as HTMLTextAreaElement).value)" /></template>
